/4jCJpbssCSGc5jhmrBMoGvWNQDf.jpg"},{"id":31004,"name":"Tone Loc","role":"Goanna (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bcrTNs5lAKkZ0LH7DQPbMoYEuVY.jpg"},{"id":35035,"name":"Townsend Coleman","role":"Knotty (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aMVAo35uihg08G8uc4Q4FiAS5ku.jpg"},{"id":81842,"name":"Brian Cummings","role":"Ock (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4q4Y9qVTPh3og39kGNWkNCmMJAx.jpg"},{"id":7210,"name":"Kathleen Freeman","role":"Edler (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pAlKHL8sshImJPCN45iQ5PGuURZ.jpg"},{"id":1107518,"name":"Naomi Lewis","role":"Elder #2 (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5fSkjzTzIgFAWmx1MD5Qx3ANkyA.jpg"},{"id":52699,"name":"Danny Mann","role":"Ash / Voice Dispatch (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/980QYqXIZCMn5Knx0vjROkw9vKo.jpg"},{"id":64951,"name":"Neil Ross","role":"Elder (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pNgkQKw5k6z9kscDnOAwstcmNnt.jpg"},{"id":21063,"name":"Pamela Adlon","role":"Fairy (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5eIRHUbNOH7ibXa0IfUfFvj5I5L.jpg"},{"id":1107519,"name":"Anderson Wong","role":"Rock (voice)"},{"id":1107517,"name":"Janet Gilmore","role":"Fairy #1 (voice)"},{"id":6008,"name":"Harry Shearer","role":"Fairy #3 (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7PnGZGVKJNDTUv3DkbaMEnCseT0.jpg"},{"id":70615,"name":"Rodger Bumpass","role":"Fairy #4 (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lGQkw6adxqB6Hcm7VK8nVHbKupe.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"FernGully - Le avventure di Zak e Crysta","overview":"In un remoto passato la foresta di Ferngully fu attaccata da Hexxus, lo spirito della distruzione (Tim Curry). Hexxus aveva il potere di avvelenare la natura, inquinando e corrompendo ogni cosa; il suo influsso fece fuggire gli umani dalla foresta, ma infine fu sconfitto dalle fate, che lo sigillarono in un baobab.","tagline":"Oltre la soglia dei vostri sogni esiste un mondo segreto, dove ogni albero è una casa, ogni suono una canzone, e gli esseri umani esistono soltanto nelle fiabe."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"When a sprite named Crysta shrinks a human boy, Zak, down to her size, he vows to help the magical fairy folk stop a greedy logging company from destroying their home: the pristine rainforest known as FernGully. Zak and his new friends fight to defend FernGully from lumberjacks — and the vengeful spirit they accidentally unleash after chopping down a magic tree.","tagline":"Just beyond your dreams lives a secret world. Where every tree is a home. Every sound is a song. And humans only exist in fairy tales. Until now..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aWHQd9mR71GP5a52rHj5GeT1ZWi.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yEWh2uS2hYEMxfMKasrf0ysw874.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":13225,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aWHQd9mR71GP5a52rHj5GeT1ZWi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aWHQd9mR71GP5a52rHj5GeT1ZWi.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aWHQd9mR71GP5a52rHj5GeT1ZWi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aWHQd9mR71GP5a52rHj5GeT1ZWi.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jT85afyYfa3iZyk2NwY2riaoriD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jT85afyYfa3iZyk2NwY2riaoriD.jpg","language":"it","width":750,"height":1125},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tKTq9IyxDbqZRi7yNxPysM4Gjqw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tKTq9IyxDbq